### Request password reset OTP
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/password-otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Confirm password reset with code (replace CODE and PASSWORD)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/password-otp/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "new_password": "NewStrongPassword123!"
}

### Login with password grant
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=user@example.com&password=NewStrongPassword123!&grant_type=password
